  "title": "How a Five-Day KAIZEN Transformed Technical Service Operations",
  "summary": "By Dieter Zink, Continuous Improvement Manager, Ludwigsstadt Continuous improvement is most effective when it goes beyond individual tasks and focuses on the entire system. That was the mindset behind a recent Kaizen initiative in the technical service department at our site in Ludwigsstadt, Germany. Over the course of one week, employees worked together to redesign the service area and improve process flow, […]",
